[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 18542.59, "timestamp": "05:09:02", "text": "そこには？ああ、木"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18546.07, "timestamp": "05:09:06", "text": "ストレージ。木箱。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18548.39, "timestamp": "05:09:08", "text": "探索ポイントが必要です。私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18550.35, "timestamp": "05:09:10", "text": "板。私は必要としている"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18552.27, "timestamp": "05:09:12", "text": "爪。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18556.47, "timestamp": "05:09:16", "text": "えっと、なんでこんなにロックされてるの？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18560.27, "timestamp": "05:09:20", "text": "銀行保管。たくさん探検しなければならない。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18569.03, "timestamp": "05:09:29", "text": "大丈夫。板を作る必要がある。私はしなければならない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18571.27, "timestamp": "05:09:31", "text": "銅を用意して切断する必要がある。どうやって"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18573.91, "timestamp": "05:09:33", "text": "銅板を買って切ってください。どうすれば入手できますか"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18575.868, "timestamp": "05:09:35", "text": "銅"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18578.708, "timestamp": "05:09:38", "text": "鉱石？兄弟、すごく苦労してるよ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18586.48, "timestamp": "05:09:46", "text": "ロックを解除します。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18587.948, "timestamp": "05:09:47", "text": "[拍手]"}]